  idCMS: CMS/Configs/MultText3
  Components:
  - rid: 6341373060195811397
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds:
    - rid: 6341373060195811397
      type: {class: MulticTag, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        lines:
        - text:
            en: But do you know what the difference is between us?
            ru: "\u041D\u043E \u0437\u043D\u0430\u0435\u0448\u044C, \u0432 \u0447\u0451\u043C
              \u0440\u0430\u0437\u043D\u0438\u0446\u0430 \u043C\u0435\u0436\u0434\u0443
              \u043D\u0430\u043C\u0438?"
          sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 82bcd83f531ac264fb0da97df0d7e1d4, type: 3}
        - text:
            en: That you're already a consumer
            ru: "\u0427\u0442\u043E \u0442\u044B - \u0443\u0436\u0435 \u043F\u043E\u0442\u0440\u0435\u0431\u0438\u0442\u0435\u043B\u044C"
          sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fbd566e9c2427c540af7b6330b3dcaac, type: 3}
        - text:
            en: And I still have to adjust and adjust...
            ru: "\u0410 \u043C\u043D\u0435 \u0435\u0449\u0451 \u043D\u0430\u0441\u0442\u0440\u0430\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0442\u044C
              \u0438 \u043D\u0430\u0441\u0442\u0440\u0430\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0442\u044C..."
          sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 81d25efa9f8514145a4854c48a341f07, type: 3}
        - text:
            en: I'm already starting to lose my mind.
            ru: "\u042F \u0443\u0436\u0435 \u043D\u0430\u0447\u0438\u043D\u0430\u044E
              \u0441\u0445\u043E\u0434\u0438\u0442\u044C \u0441 \u0443\u043C\u0430"
          sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: eff3f1c278be8324785ceb4aa4148d11, type: 3}
        - text:
            en: But soon... It's all over
            ru: "\u041D\u043E \u0441\u043A\u043E\u0440\u043E... \u044D\u0442\u043E
              \u0432\u0441\u0451 \u0437\u0430\u043A\u043E\u043D\u0447\u0438\u0442\u0441\u044F"
          sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 39beacf567fd7d74a80a19b6d62ec871, type: 3}
        - text:
            en: I WILL GET RID OF THIS TORTURE FOREVER.
            ru: "\u042F \u0418\u0417\u0411\u0410\u0412\u041B\u042E\u0421\u042C \u041E\u0422
              \u042D\u0422\u041E\u0419 \u041F\u042B\u0422\u041A\u0418 \u041D\u0410\u0412\u0421\u0415\u0413\u0414\u0410"
          sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6d1c67016f733c24888aff74d038f9ab, type: 3}
